  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extra activities for RBC agreement for Renewable Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project &apos;Extra activities for international responsible business conduct (RBC) agreement for Renewable Energy&apos;, CNV International, FNV, International Union for Conservation of Nature and Natural Resources (IUCN), Terre des Hommes, De Noordzee Foundation and Danish Institute for Human Rights contribute their knowledge and experience to support Dutch companies with implementing human resources (HR) due diligence during the implementation phase of RBC sector agreement for Renewable Energy.</narrative>
  </description>
